tus\":\"Filed\",\"dof\":\"25/10/2025\",\"arn\":\"NA\"},{\"fy\":\"2025-2026\",\"taxp\":\"August\",\"rtntype\":\"GSTR3B\",\"status\":\"Filed\",\"dof\":\"20/09/2025\",\"arn\":\"NA\"},{\"fy\":\"2025-2026\",\"taxp\":\"July\",\"rtntype\":\"GSTR3B\",\"status\":\"Filed\",\"dof\":\"20/08/2025\",\"arn\":\"NA\"},{\"fy\":\"2025-2026\",\"taxp\":\"June\",\"rtntype\":\"GSTR3B\",\"status\":\"Filed\",\"dof\":\"22/07/2025\",\"arn\":\"NA\"}],\"return_filing_updated_at\":\"$D2026-07-01T09:56:07.872Z\",\"return_filing_years\":[\"2026\",\"2025\"],\"hsn_codes\":[{\"code\":\"00440108\",\"description\":\"SECURITY / DETECTIVE AGENCIES\",\"type\":\"S\"}],\"hsn_updated_at\":\"$D2025-12-22T22:22:43.014Z\",\"updated_at\":\"$D2026-07-14T03:25:41.726Z\",\"healthScore\":753,\"healthScoreUpdatedAt\":\"$D2026-05-27T23:41:50.594Z\",\"hsn_codes_updated_at\":\"$D2026-07-01T09:56:07.925Z\"},\"gstinAge\":\"9 years 2 months\",\"healthScore\":800,\"healthInfo\":{\"label\":\"Excellent\",\"color\":\"text-green-700\",\"bgColor\":\"bg-green-50 border-green-200\"},\"aiInsights\":[\"Mid-to-large scale operations (₹25-100 Cr) - Strong business foundation\",\"9+ years in business - Established market presence\"],\"faqData\":[{\"question\":\"What is GSTIN 27AAACR5047D1ZM?\",\"answer\":\"GSTIN 27AAACR5047D1ZM is the Goods and Services Tax Identification Number for HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED. It is registered as Regular taxpayer with registration date 01/07/2017. This unique 15-digit number is issued by the GST department to identify taxpayers.\"},{\"question\":\"Is HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED GST compliant?\",\"answer\":\"The current status of GSTIN 27AAACR5047D1ZM is \\\"Active\\\". This indicates the business is registered and operational under GST. Active status means the taxpayer is authorized to collect GST and file returns.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the turnover of HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED?\",\"answer\":\"According to GST records, HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED has an aggregate turnover of Slab: Rs. 25 Cr. to 100 Cr.  for the financial year 2025-26. Aggregate turnover includes all taxable supplies, exports, and exempt supplies made by the business.\"},{\"question\":\"Does HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED support E-Invoicing?\",\"answer\":\"E-Invoice status for GSTIN 27AAACR5047D1ZM is: No. E-invoicing may not be mandatory for this business based on current turnover thresholds.\"},{\"question\":\"How many business locations does HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED have?\",\"answer\":\"HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED has 1 registered business location(s) under this GSTIN - 1 principal place of business. Each location must be registered separately for GST compliance.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the nature of business for HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED?\",\"answer\":\"The nature of business activities registered under this GSTIN is: Service Provider and Others. This classification helps determine applicable GST rates and compliance requirements for the business.\"},{\"question\":\"How is the AI Business Health Score calculated?\",\"answer\":\"The AI Business Health Score is calculated using multiple factors out of 1000 points: Active Status (250 points), E-Invoice Compliance (150 points), Filing Compliance (300 points total - comprising Recent Filing Rate for last 6 months: 180 points, Filing Consistency over 12 months: 80 points, and Return Type Completeness: 40 points), Business Maturity based on registration age (200 points, 30 points per year), and Turnover Scale (0-100 points based on annual turnover slab). The Filing Compliance score analyzes actual GSTR1 and GSTR3B return filing behavior including timely filing, consistency without gaps, and completeness of both return types. This score provides a comprehensive overview of business compliance health but should not be the sole criterion for business decisions.\"},{\"question\":\"Is this data real-time?\",\"answer\":\"The data shown here is public information sourced from GST records and cached for performance. Authenticated users can refresh return filing history data directly from the GST Portal using the \\\"Refresh Data\\\" button to get the latest current and previous year filing records. For the most current and official information, please visit the official GST portal at https://www.gst.gov.in/. We recommend verifying critical business decisions with official sources.\"},{\"question\":\"How can I refresh the return filing data?\",\"answer\":\"Signed-in users can refresh GST return filing history by clicking the \\\"Refresh Data\\\" button located in the GST Return Filing History section. This feature fetches the latest filing records for both current and previous financial years directly from the GST Portal (services.gst.gov.in). The refreshed data includes GSTR1 and GSTR3B filing status, dates, and acknowledgment details. This ensures you have the most up-to-date filing compliance information for accurate health score calculations.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the taxpayer type for HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED?\",\"answer\":\"HELICTITE RESIDENCY PRIVATE LIMITED is registered as \\\"Regular\\\" taxpayer. Regular taxpayers follow standard GST compliance with monthly/quarterly return filing and can claim input tax credit.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I use this information for business verification?\",\"answer\":\"While this information is sourced from public GST records, it should be used as a reference only. For official verification, business due diligence, or legal purposes, always verify information directly from the GST portal (https://www.gst.gov.in/) or consult with tax professionals.\"}],\"relatedGSTINsData\":{\"pan\":\"AAACR5047D\",\"currentGSTIN\":\"27AAACR5047D1ZM\",\"relatedGSTINs\":[],\"groupedByStatus\":{},\"total\":0},\"liveUsersCount\":117}]\n"])</script></body></html>